          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Take a plain square sheet of paper (use a newspaper for this activity).",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.56,
            0.877,
            0.601
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "How would you describe the opposite edges of the sheet? They",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " are to each other."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.605,
            0.866,
            0.669
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "How would you describe the adjacent edges of the sheet? The",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " adjacent edges are to each other. They meet at a point. "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "They form right angles.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.672,
            0.858,
            0.713
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Fold the sheet horizontally in half. A new line is formed (see Fig. 5.7).",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
